## 7. Design System Notes

**Tokens** (CSS vars in `globals.css`):
```
--radius: 14px            # cards
--radius-sm: 10px         # inputs / chips
--shadow-soft: 0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,.04), 0 4px 12px rgba(16,24,40,.04);
--shadow-pop:  0 8px 24px rgba(16,24,40,.08);
--bg: #fafafa
--surface: #ffffff
--border: #ececec
--text: #0f1115
--muted: #6b7280
--accent: #111 (subject to brand pass)
```

**Spacing rule:** generous whitespace — minimum `p-6` on cards, `gap-6` in grids, `space-y-8` between page sections.

**Animation rule:** ≤200ms, ease-out, transform/opacity only. No bounce. No spinning loaders > 1s — use skeletons.

---

## 8. Claude API Conventions

- All Claude calls server-side. Model: `claude-opus-4-7`.
- Use prompt caching for the long system prompts (PRD context block in chat is the prime candidate).
- Always pass a JSON-output system instruction for non-chat features (extract stack, extract features, generate knowledge); validate with `zod` before persisting.
- Stream only the chat endpoint. Generators (knowledge / features / stack) return full JSON.

